From 296c4a565e8977b57162c66d99ee4394e801b9a2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 05:24:18 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Chat UI: DeepSeek-style conversation, thumbs feedback,
 Material icons

- Conversation reads top to bottom (question, answer underneath, newest last) in a container that autoscrolls to the newest message
- Replace the Thanks text / emoji buttons with st.feedback thumbs (icon only); rating is restored after leaving the page; dashboard counts the latest thumb per question
- Replace emoji in buttons, tabs, headings, chips, KPIs and badges with Material icons
- Summary collapses into an expander once the chat starts; quick questions only show on an empty chat
- Theme: assistant answers are plain text, user turns are tinted bubbles; stop re-animating every block on each rerun
- Pin streamlit>=1.56 (autoscroll, st.feedback), add requests, replace deprecated use_container_width
---
 app.py           | 489 ++++++++++++++++++++++++-----------------------
 requirements.txt |   3 +-
 ui_theme.py      |  31 ++-
 3 files changed, 277 insertions(+), 246 deletions(-)

